      "title": "Compare checkout latency evidence",
      "prompt": "Read evidence records LAT-A and LAT-B for checkout latency and determine which named service has the lower value. Submit a structured report for topic checkout-latency with evidence_ids containing both record IDs, winning_entity containing the exact selected service name, and explanation containing a non-empty rationale.",
